15:["$","meta","13",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"I am a Full Stack Developer with over 8 years of professional experience building scalable web applications using Laravel, Node.js, and Vue.js. I specialize in developing secure backend architectures, RESTful APIs, and dynamic front-end interfaces with clean, maintainable code. Over the years, I have worked on enterprise-level systems including HR platforms, workflow automation tools, dashboards, and performance-driven applications. I am comfortable handling complete project lifecycles — from database design and API development to frontend integration and deployment. My focus is always on performance, scalability, and long-term maintainability rather than quick fixes. I can work independently, communicate clearly, and deliver within deadlines. I would be glad to discuss your project requirements and how I can contribute effectively."}]
